### Test POST to SignalRFunction negotiate
POST http://localhost:7071/api/negotiate
Content-Type: application/json

### Test SendUploadProgress directly (use your correlation ID from browser console)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/SendUploadProgress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correlationId": "782e8a46-a589-46db-a6cc-800fe2a08bb7",
  "uploadId": "test-manual-progress",
  "processedRecords": 25,
  "totalRecords": 100,
  "percentageComplete": 25.0,
  "currentStatus": "Manual test - Processing 25 of 100 records"
}

